  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nWhen looking at for example navigate-event/navigate-history-pushState.html, the test expectation for hashChange is false. However from looking at the specification it should be true. It seems when using History API the determination is different, yet this does not seem reflected in the specification AFAICS.",
